(1364,'festival','Flower & Garden had character topiaries and kitchens in spring 2026.',['These are explicitly listed under this festival\'s 2026 highlights.','Food & Wine is a separately named festival, not the spring event heading.','Festival of the Arts is a separate festival.','Festival of the Holidays is a separate festival.'],'Other EPCOT festivals have food, so the spring 2026 topiary-and-kitchen context is retained. The historical date prevents future offerings from changing the answer.'),
(1365,'america','Franklin and Twain guide The American Adventure.',['Disney identifies both men as the guides.','Washington and Jefferson are not the designated host pair.','Lincoln and Roosevelt are not the two named guides.','Walt and Lincoln are not the identified host pair.'],'Appearing during the show is not equivalent to hosting it: the source separately calls other figures encounters. Both names in each pair must fit.'),
